<blockquote>
<p>How can the Foundation be so sure that this is anomalous? No really, hear me out.<br />
For how few &quot;cases&quot; there are, why couldn't this just be random strokes or seizures?</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Some of the other details aside, for me, the Foundation is smart enough to know that it wasn't some random strokes or seizures because stuff like that is easily or at least can be detected in autopsies.</p>
I could add a footnote explicitly saying that the victims had no prior illness/abnormalities that may have caused the paralysis nor any signs of seizures or strokes.<br />
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">open&nbsp;block</a></div>
